WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:07.132
Death comes...

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:08.883
for us all.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.764
It's all I know
for sure.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.019
The question isn't...

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:22.772
are you prepared
to die?

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:26.985
The question is:
who would you be...

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:30.363
when you close
your eyes?

